## Why This Is Asked
Tests caching strategy decisions, race condition handling, and integration with Kafka for consistency.

## Key Concepts
- Caching strategy choices (explicit invalidate vs write-through vs lazy)
- Race condition mitigation (locks, double-checked patterns)
- Cross-service invalidation via Kafka events
- End-to-end testing and rollback plans

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: explicit invalidation on write
async function updateProduct(id, data) {
  await db.update('products', id, data);
  await redis.del(`product:list`);
  await redis.del(`product:${id}`);
  await publishEvent('product.updated', { id });
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you monitor cache stampede risk and tune TTLs?
- How would you test failure modes where Redis is unavailable during invalidation?
